  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The Shader class manages the complete lifecycle of WebGL shader programs, abstracting compilation, linking, and configuration for rendering pipelines. It handles the asynchronous loading and substitution of GLSL source code, incorporating preprocessor directives and function inclusions via the Resources manager. It is responsible for uploading geometry data from MeshData to GPU buffers and setting uniforms for material properties and transformations."
  },
